  "sourceTitle": "Fixed-weight models are adversarially vulnerable: hence misaligned",
  "sourceBodyHash": "ca05731ca2605421d9a1babdd7418cbd73ea290a94777144e30fe9d554439825",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
